      ],
      "findings": [
        "II.09 identifies a gulf between giving and taking; it does not call the relationship between people the object given. III.04 blesses things and says chance was restored to them, but does not show that “the object of giving shifts from a relationship to freedom of things”. Compare the different subjects and acts without claiming a change of object or a recipient response."
      ]
